!! Distributed Failure and Generative Testing

> "Testing under distributed systems failure modes: faulty networks, unsynchronized clocks, and partial failure."

Source: https://jepsen.io/analyses

> "Generative testing: we construct random operations, apply them to the system, and construct a concurrent history of their results."

Source: https://jepsen.io/analyses

