!! Security Testing and Authorization Automation

> "To deal with this problem, we recommend that developers automate the evaluation of the authorizations and perform a test when a new release is created."

Source: https://cheatsheetseries.owasp.org/cheatsheets/Authorization_Testing_Automation_Cheat_Sheet.html

> "Don't assume WebSocket connection equals unlimited access. Check authorization for each action:"

Source: https://cheatsheetseries.owasp.org/cheatsheets/WebSocket_Security_Cheat_Sheet.html

> "Persistent WebSocket connections increase DoS risk."

Source: https://cheatsheetseries.owasp.org/cheatsheets/WebSocket_Security_Cheat_Sheet.html

